WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:25.550
Ben: I can't believe the Pet Lovers Club is going to the zoo!

2
00:00:25.551 --> 00:00:28.640
Riley: Poor Snooks couldn't come.

3
00:00:28.641 --> 00:00:31.704
Dogs aren't allowed at the zoo.

4
00:00:31.705 --> 00:00:46.085
Riley: But I'll take some pictures for him.

5
00:00:46.086 --> 00:00:48.508
Sarah: Are we there yet?

6
00:00:48.509 --> 00:01:00.638
Mrs. Summers: Almost! We're going into the tunnel.

7
00:01:00.639 --> 00:01:02.997
Sarah: I don't like tunnels.

8
00:01:02.998 --> 00:01:04.558
Ben: Close your eyes.

9
00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:17.141
Chatter: Close your eyes, big surprise!

10
00:01:17.142 --> 00:01:19.107
Riley: We're here!

11
00:01:19.108 --> 00:01:22.175
Chatter: Go home! Do your homework!

12
00:01:22.176 --> 00:01:24.393
Theo: No way, Chatter.

13
00:01:24.394 --> 00:01:35.405
This is super exciting!

14
00:01:35.406 --> 00:01:37.464
Mrs. Summers: Everyone stay together.

15
00:01:37.465 --> 00:01:40.191
Mrs. Summers: We're going downstairs to the subway train.

16
00:01:40.192 --> 00:01:43.800
Riley: The subway speeds under the city.

17
00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:56.899
Ben: It goes right to the zoo!

18
00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:00.114
Riley: There's so much to see.

19
00:02:00.115 --> 00:02:03.440
Where do we start?

20
00:02:03.441 --> 00:02:08.914
Sarah: Mittens wants to look at the big cats.

21
00:02:08.915 --> 00:02:12.826
Ben: Speedy wants to see the crocodile.

22
00:02:12.827 --> 00:02:22.232
Theo: Whiskers is afraid of crocodiles.

23
00:02:22.233 --> 00:02:28.220
Mrs. Summers: The crocodile is in Reptile Ranch.

24
00:02:28.221 --> 00:02:32.721
Riley: Look, it's right over there.

25
00:02:32.722 --> 00:02:38.581
Ben: Let's go inside.

26
00:02:38.582 --> 00:02:45.193
Theo: I want to see the tomato frog.

27
00:02:45.194 --> 00:02:47.592
Sarah: What's a tomato frog?

28
00:02:47.593 --> 00:02:49.580
Ben: There's one. See?

29
00:02:49.581 --> 00:02:52.646
It puffs up like a tomato.

30
00:02:52.647 --> 00:02:55.574
Riley: Then other animals won't eat it.

31
00:02:55.575 --> 00:03:02.949
Theo: I wouldn't eat it either.

32
00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.869
Skyler: There's the giant crocodile.

33
00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:12.821
Sarah: Its jaws are wide open!

34
00:03:12.822 --> 00:03:17.914
Theo: Whiskers is so scared, he's shaking!

35
00:03:17.915 --> 00:03:28.914
Riley: If Snooks were here, he'd be howling like crazy!
